From: plotarmordev <299844489+plotarmordev@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 11:13:28 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 29/30] drama: the tower's one-row projections on
 drama_tower_gemv, in cuBLASLt's summation order

drama_tower_gemv sums in the order of the gemv kernel cuBLASLt picks for the tower's one-row plans. At init each
projection is checked against its cuBLASLt plan bit for bit and uses the kernel only if they agree.
